# React Frontend

- Functional components with hooks; extract reusable logic into custom hooks
- API calls in dedicated service modules aligned with backend REST resources
- Every async view handles loading, error, and empty states
- Environment-specific API base URL via build config (never hardcode prod URLs)
- Mirror backend validation; display server `ErrorCode` messages consistently
- Prefer composition over deep prop drilling; keep components focused
